## Getting started

Foundry and the npm dependencies are both required — the Solidity remappings in `foundry.toml`
resolve CoFHE's contracts out of `node_modules`.

```bash
cp .env.example .env
{{pm}} install
{{pmRun}} test
```

`@cofhe/foundry-plugin` supplies `CofheTest`, which deploys the CoFHE mock contracts in `setUp()`,
and `CofheClient`, which encrypts inputs and produces decryption signatures inside the test VM.
